silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_01_olog_as_typed_english_sections_02_four_artifacts_of_olog_concrete_anchor_2_Arrows#hasasbodymassarrow silm:hasLongDescription "The HasAsBodyMassArrow is the arrows set: typed-verb morphisms; e.g. has as body mass : DomesticCatBox -> BodyMassQualityBox. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Arrows', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
